  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Blend raspberries, tequila, orange juice, lemon juice, orange liqueur, superfine sugar, and mint leaves in a blender until smooth. Add ice cubes individually, crushing each one before adding the next. Pour into chilled cocktail glasses to serve.",
